{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14108202","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108202","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410820101:":{"text":"追え！","source_cn":"追！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C08ADD1DB1ED7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410820102:":{"text":"放っておきなさい。","source_cn":"没事，别管他们了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x593FC77275D383D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410820201:0":{"text":"エイン殿、奴らを行かせるわけには……","source_cn":"奎茵，不能放走他们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B2E7DC247A85418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410820202:1":{"text":"心配なのは分かりますが――","source_cn":"我理解您的担忧，都铎大人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA321B6199AC11A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410820203:1":{"text":"霊水を拒んだ以上、遅かれ早かれインドラは厄化するでしょう。","source_cn":"因度厄已经拒绝了灵露。没有恩典的滋养，他很快就会孽化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x726C086527DACE17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410820204:1":{"text":"そうなった彼に残された道は二つ、仲間に殺されるか、魔物に成り果てるか……","source_cn":"到那时候，他的同伴要么亲手了结他，要么看着他变成怪物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D535CF8BB847637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410820205:1":{"text":"どちらにせよ、我々が手を下すまでもありません。","source_cn":"这比杀了他更好，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x411B0814BFE71ACC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410820206:1":{"text":"ですが、万が一……","source_cn":"万一……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12B36E28CB55D895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410820207:1":{"text":"万が一彼が改心し、霊水を口にしたのなら……","source_cn":"万一他回心转意，喝下恩典灵露……那就更好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B53F536C352977C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410820208:1":{"text":"それは彼が陛下の御心を理解したという証拠です。","source_cn":"他就会明白女王大人的良苦用心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259E12AEA3C1C543","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410820209:1":{"text":"しかし……","source_cn":"但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF42FF06FD148D39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410820210:1":{"text":"これは陛下の御意志なのですよ。","source_cn":"这是陛下的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8FAB954BCFEB207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410820211:0":{"text":"分かりました。皆のもの、追撃止め――","source_cn":"我明白了。众士兵听令，停止追击——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66F3092E83D606C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1410820212:0":{"text":"同時刻、あなたとゾーヤとインドラは、ヘクトの神殿に到着した。","source_cn":"与此同时，你、祖娅和因度厄也成功传送到赫托神殿……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65CCCACC177FDE85","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"同時刻、あなたとゾーヤとインドラは、ヘクトの神殿に到着した。","female":"同時刻、あなたとゾーヤとインドラは、ヘクトの神殿に到着した。","variant_male_record_index":"160317","variant_female_record_index":"160318","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:140108119:0":{"text":"テレポート魔法陣で、なんとか宮殿から脱出することができた。タドールが追撃しようとした時、エインがその前に立ち塞がった。","source_cn":"你们紧急传送离开了宫殿，都铎试图继续追击时，被奎茵拦了下来。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BBE84EA3AADA3CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"テレポート魔法陣で、なんとか宮殿から脱出することができた。タドールが追撃しようとした時、エインがその前に立ち塞がった。","female":"テレポート魔法陣で、なんとか宮殿から脱出することができた。タドールが追撃しようとした時、エインがその前に立ち塞がった。","variant_male_record_index":"168108","variant_female_record_index":"168109","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:都铎":{"text":"タドール","source":"都铎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奎茵":{"text":"エイン","source":"奎茵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}}